  "text": "Stories\nNews\nMedia Resources\nAbout\nContact\nRegion\nFEATURED STORY\nVenmo Launches Receipt Scanning Feature to Split Bills by Item\n\nOne photo, zero math: Snap a photo and Venmo itemizes the receipt, adds tax and tip, and sends the requests.\n\nRead more\nLatest News\nPERFORMANCEQUARTERLY EARNINGS\nPayPal Reports Third Quarter 2026 Results\n\nPayPal announced its third quarter 2026 results for the period ended September 30, 2026.\n\nRead more\nOct 27, 2026\nPRODUCTVENMO\nThe Venmo Credit Card Now Pays Up to 4% Cash Back When You Split with Friends\n\nThe Venmo Credit Card now rewards social spending with an industry-first feature that offers cardholders more cash back for splitting purchases with friends on Venmo.\n\nRead more\nOct 5, 2026\nPRODUCTPERFORMANCE\nPayPal Survey Reveals Holiday Spending Isn't Slowing Down, But Shoppers Are Changing How They Spend\n\nShoppers start earlier, seek value, and prioritize flexibility, as PayPal offers more ways to help.\n\nRead more\nSep 30, 2026\nPRODUCTVENMO\nVenmo Kicks Off 2026-2027 NIL Season with Nine Standout Student-Athletes and Introduces Money Moves\n\nNew initiative spotlights rising stars across football, basketball, volleyball, gymnastics, and softball as they turn a portion of their NIL earnings into acts of gratitude for the communities behind them.\n\nRead more\nSep 16, 2026\nPRODUCTPAYPALVENMO\nPayPal and Venmo Expand to Tuition Payments in New Integrations with Illumia, Nelnet Campus Commerce, and TouchNet\n\nStudents and families can now choose PayPal or Venmo to pay tuition.\n\nRead more\nAug 19, 2026\nPRODUCTPAYPALINNOVATION\nPayPal World Enables US Travelers to Pay Like a Local at Weixin Pay Merchants Across China\n\nPayPal World enables US PayPal users to make in-store QR code payments at Weixin Pay merchants across China, with no additional app or local bank account needed.\n\nRead more\nAug 11, 2026\n\nSee all news\n\nAdditional Stories\nPRODUCTVENMO\nGen Z's Secret to College Friendships Staying Together? “Splitting Up”\n\nNew Venmo research reveals campus life’s not-so-secret rule: splitting the bill isn’t breaking up friend groups – it’s holding them together.\n\nRead more\nOct 14, 2026\nPERFORMANCECULTURESOCIAL IMPACT\nPayPal and Global Citizen Expand Their Small Business Impact Award Program\n\nSmall Business Impact Awards program supports PayPal's goal to help 25 million people and small businesses thrive in the digital economy by 2030.\n\nRead more\nSep 21, 2026\nPRODUCTINNOVATIONTECHNOLOGY\nPayPal Takes Center Stage at Ai4 2026\n\nAt Ai4 2026 in Las Vegas, PayPal made the case that the biggest obstacle to AI adoption is trust.\n\nRead more\nAug 10, 2026\n\nSee all stories\n\nStay up to date.\n\nSign up to receive the latest news to your email.\n\nSubscribe\n\nPayPal.com\nVenmo.com\nJoinHoney.com\n\nOur Global Newsrooms\nGlobal/USA\nAsia Pacific\nAustralia\nBrazil\nCanada\nChina\nFrance\nGermany\nIreland\nItaly\nJapan\nLatin America\nSpain\nUK\nStay Connected\n\n© PayPal 2026 All rights reserved.\n\nContact Us CookiesPrivacy\n\nIf you accept cookies, we’ll use them to improve and customize your experience and enable our partners to show you personalized ads when you visit other sites. Manage cookies and learn more\n\nAccept\nDecline",
  "title": "PayPal Newsroom | Home",
  "url": "https://newsroom.paypal-corp.com/"
}
